19	/// This modules includes implementations for converting an ESLint config to a Biome config.
20	///
21	/// The conversion relies on:
22	/// - the generated [super::eslint_any_rule_to_biome::migrate_eslint_any_rule]
23	///   module that relies on Biome's rule metadata to determine
24	///   the equivalent Biome's rule of an Eslint rule
25	/// - hand-written handling of Biome rules that have options in the current module.
